docs/HANDOFF.md
docs/PROJECT_LOG.md
docs/FEEDBACK-BACKLOG.md
docs/RELEASE-HISTORY.md

# local release artifacts
/patches/

# bundled model files: shipped inside the distribution package, too large for git
comfyui-gateway/resources/bundled/
comfyui-gateway/resources/loras/*.safetensors

